From: tawc-fork
Origin: own

EGL Wayland: fall through to Kopper-Zink when there is no /dev/dri, and
force zink as the Gallium driver in that fallback.

tawc-on-Android exposes no DRM node, so dri2_initialize_wayland_drm always
fails. This build has zink as its only Gallium driver, so the swrast
fallback must select zink (driver_name="zink") or dri2_load_driver finds
nothing. MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE=zink does not set Options.Zink on the
wayland path, so set it explicitly and force fd_render_gpu=-1 (Kopper takes
the no-DRM path; the calloc default of 0 would ioctl stdin).

diff --git a/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c b/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c
index 59cfa753290..dea5e9546cd 100644
--- a/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c
+++ b/src/egl/drivers/dri2/platform_wayland.c
@@ -3251,10 +3251,28 @@ cleanup:
 EGLBoolean
 dri2_initialize_wayland(_EGLDisplay *disp)
 {
-   if (disp->Options.ForceSoftware)
+   if (disp->Options.ForceSoftware) {
+      /* tawc-fork: zink is the only Gallium driver in this build, so the
+       * swrast path must select it or dri2_load_driver finds nothing. */
+      disp->Options.Zink = EGL_TRUE;
       return dri2_initialize_wayland_swrast(disp);
-   else
-      return dri2_initialize_wayland_drm(disp);
+   }
+   if (dri2_initialize_wayland_drm(disp))
+      return EGL_TRUE;
+   /* tawc-fork: with MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE=zink, the DRM init
+    * may have failed simply because there is no /dev/dri/ on this
+    * system (tawc-on-Android). The swrast init already handles
+    * driver_name="zink" + Kopper for the no-KMS case; fall through
+    * to it instead of letting eglapi.c's retry reset Options.Zink.
+    * Force fd_render_gpu=-1 so dri2_create_screen passes -1 to
+    * driCreateNewScreen3 (Kopper takes the no-DRM path with -1; with
+    * the calloc default of 0 it would do DRM ioctls on stdin). Same
+    * trick `surfaceless_probe_device_sw` uses upstream. */
+   /* tawc-fork: no /dev/dri on tawc-on-Android, and zink is the only
+    * Gallium driver built, so always fall through to Kopper-Zink. */
+   disp->Options.Zink = EGL_TRUE;
+   dri2_egl_display(disp)->fd_render_gpu = -1;
+   return dri2_initialize_wayland_swrast(disp);
 }
 
 void
